# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER-SHIP CLASSES
#
# Nothing derived from Funcom's shipped files belongs in this repository, even
# when it is convenient. Tooling that GENERATES these locally is welcome; the
# output of that tooling is not. See NOTICE.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Game-derived art and assets: regenerate locally, never commit
*.pak
*.utoc
*.ucas
*.uasset
*.umap
*.glb
*.gltf
assets/extracted/
static/glb/
static/textures/
static/img/dune-icons/
**/icons-extracted/

